        "alt": "普泰拉诺龙——家长指南——如何培养好奇心",
        "url": "https://assets.tangobook.co.kr/1773899014599-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B9%A8%EC%97%86%EB%8A%94%EB%B6%80%EB%A6%AC%EC%99%80%EA%B1%B0%EB%8C%80%ED%95%9C%EB%82%A0%EA%B0%9C%EB%A5%BC%EA%B0%80%EC%A7%84%ED%95%98%EB%8A%98%EC%9D%98%EC%A3%BC%EC%9D%B8%ED%94%84%ED%85%8C%EB%9D%BC%EB%85%B8%EB%8F%88-illustration-page15-1773899383127.webp",
        "text": "<h2>父母指南 — 如何培养好奇心</h2><p>区分“恐龙在地上，翼龙在天上”，并飞纸飞机时谈论一下翅膀的原理。与鸟类和蝙蝠的翅膀进行比较，能让孩子更有兴趣。</p>",
        "caption": "飞行原理游戏",
        "image_style": "",
        "image_prompt": "A parent and child flying paper airplanes, warm children's book illustration, no text"
      }
